      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Code Generation**\n\nI'm starting by building `register_user.py` using the Microsoft/OpenAI stack. Once that's underway, I'll generate the placeholder files. This initial focus allows me to lay a solid foundation before expanding to the other components.\n\n\n**Creating User Registration**\n\nI'm now focusing on `register_user.py`, utilizing the `openai` library to simulate user registration. My current step involves importing `openai` and creating a basic function for user registration. This ensures a functional core before I proceed to the placeholder files. I'm building this first.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789897493289,
          "start": 1789897492033
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0be344641001ZX6Q8xfoaS1c16",
